###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534341
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534341> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "semiconductor charge neutrality"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "At Ohmic contacts, the local charge-neutrality condition is often used to determine the built-in voltage by requiring zero net charge density from mobile carriers and ionized dopants. Unlike global neutrality, which only requires the total integrated charge to vanish, local charge-neutrality applies pointwise. The resulting local charge-neutrality potential can also serve as an initial guess for solving the nonlinear Poisson equation to determine thermodynamic equilibrium."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6673783> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6673784> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6673827> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6673831> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6673929> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q7284039> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q7284040> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "concept of local charge neutrality in semiconductor"@en .


