                                               rdfs:label "Lyapunov generalized controllability"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "For a numerical solution, one can resort to iterative schemes, which requires the solution of a standard Lyapunov equation in each step. As an alternative, one may use the biconjugate gradient method (with preconditioner) as suggested by Tobias Breiten from TU Graz, Austria, now TU Berlin."@en ,
