                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∝</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mi>ρ</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "transport equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P12> "Q105560509"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "There are several (constitutive) equations which describe the transport of matter, or properties of it, in an almost identical way. In every case, in words they read: Flux (density) is proportional to a gradient, where the constant of proportionality is a characteristic of the material. In general, the constant must be replaced by a 2nd rank tensor, to account for directional dependencies of the material."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1684> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674255> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674304> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674310> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674324> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674358> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775445> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1691> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674283> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "equation that describes the transport of some (extensive) quantity such as mass, energy|heat, momentum, electric charge"@en .

