###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674355
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674355> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q96183> ;
                                               rdfs:label "finite volume method"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P104> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Finite_volume_method> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P12> "Q1401936"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Finite volume methods can be compared and contrasted with the finite difference methods, which approximate derivatives using nodal values, or finite element methods, which create local approximations of a solution using local data, and construct a global approximation by stitching them together."@en ,
                                                                                           "In the finite volume method, volume integrals in a partial differential equation that contain a divergence term are converted to surface integrals, using the divergence theorem. These terms are then evaluated as fluxes at the surfaces of each finite volume."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1684> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674286> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674287> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674306> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674356> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6674357> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1994> "finite volume method"@en ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "method for representing and evaluating partial differential equations in the form of algebraic equations"@en .


