                                               rdfs:label "empirical distribution of individuals formulation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Empirical distribution of individuals that follow a medium 𝑚 and influencer 𝑙 at time 𝑡 by the sum of Dirac delta distributions δ placed at the individuals’ opinions. This distribution describes the stochastic opinion instances at a given time and integrates to ∫ᴰ ρₘ,ₗ⁽ᴺ⁾(𝑥, 𝑡) 𝑑𝑥 ≔ 𝑛ₘ,ₗ⁽ᴺ⁾(𝑡), the proportion of individuals that follow medium 𝑚 and influencer 𝑙."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
