                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Semiconductor drift-diffusion models are closely related to reaction–diffusion systems and Poisson–Nernst–Planck models. The latter are used in biological applications to model electro-diffusive ion transport through ion channels across cell membranes."@en ,
