###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684617
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684617> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "semiconductor thermodynamic equilibrium"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Defines semiconductor thermodynamic equilibrium as the solution of the nonlinear Poisson equation. The resulting electrostatic potential is the built-in potential, for which drift and diffusion currents exactly balance each other, yielding zero net current."@en ;
