                                                                                           <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q110779037> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6672278> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "mathematical model for transmission electron microscopy of nanostructures"@en .


