###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684691
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684691> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "uni uni reaction with non-competitive complete inhibition"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Enzyme (E) and Substrate (S) form an enzyme-substrate complex (ES), which catalyzes the formation of product (P). Rates for complex formation and dissociation are k₁ and k₋₁, k₂ is the rate of the rate-determining enzymatic step of product formation. Free enzyme and the enzyme-substrate complex may bind an inhibitor (I) to form an enzyme-inhibitor (EI) and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex (EIS) with k₃ or k₋₃ and k₄ or k₋₄ as rates of inhibitor complex formation and depletion. Enzyme-inhibitor complex and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate convert into each other with rates k₅ and k₋₅. In the non-competitive case: k₃ = k₄,  k₋₃ = k₋₄, k₅ = k₁, and k₋₅ = k₋₁. The enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex cannot form product, the inhibition is thus complete."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1684> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684668> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "uni uni reaction with inhibition"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684692
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6684692> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "uni uni reaction with non-competitive partial inhibition"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Enzyme (E) and Substrate (S) form an enzyme-substrate complex (ES), which catalyzes the formation of product (P). Rates for complex formation and dissociation are k₁ and k₋₁, k₂ is the rate of the rate-determining enzymatic step of product formation. Free enzyme and the enzyme-substrate complex may bind an inhibitor (I) to form an enzyme-inhibitor (EI) and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex (EIS) with k₃ or k₋₃ and k₄ or k₋₄ as rates of inhibitor complex formation and depletion. Enzyme-inhibitor complex and enzyme-inhibitor-substrate convert into each other with rates k₅ and k₋₅. In the non-competitive case: k₃ = k₄, k₋₃ = k₋₄, k₅ = k₁, and k₋₅ = k₋₁. The enzyme-inhibitor-substrate complex can form product with rate k₆."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
