###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775767
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775767> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "nonlinear parameter estimation (Langmuir adsorption model)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task performs nonlinear parameter estimation using experimental adsorption equilibrium data. The objective is to determine the Langmuir adsorption constant and maximum monolayer adsorption capacity by fitting the nonlinear Langmuir equation directly to measured solute concentration and adsorbed amount data. The results quantify the adsorption affinity and monolayer capacity of the adsorbent without bias from linearization."@en ;
