###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820981
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820981> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "Flory-Huggins isotherm model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "The Flory–Huggins isotherm is an empirical adsorption model adapted from polymer solution theory that describes how chemically similar molecules of different chain length occupy adsorbent sites. It uses a coverage degree defined from initial and equilibrium concentrations and explicitly accounts for an occupancy number that represents how many adsorbate units occupy a site. The model is used to assess adsorption feasibility and spontaneity via an equilibrium constant that can be related to a standard Gibbs free-energy expression. It is applied when adsorbate molecules are large or chain-like (e.g., polymers, large organics) and the adsorbate–adsorbent arrangement is approximately random."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820982> ,
                                                                                          <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820983> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820989> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775858> ,
                                                                                          <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821374> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P558> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820990> ,
                                                                                          <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820991> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "adsorption model for multi-site occupancy and chain effects"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820982
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820982> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "nonlinear parameter estimation (Flory-Huggins model)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task fits the nonlinear Flory–Huggins equation to adsorption data to estimate the Flory–Huggins equilibrium constant and the occupancy number. It uses experimental initial and equilibrium concentrations and measured uptake to directly obtain parameter estimates without data linearization. The outputs quantify the effective site occupancy per adsorbate and the equilibrium parameter used to evaluate spontaneity."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820984> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820985> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820986> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6820987> ,
