###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821058
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821058> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "Jovanovic multilayer isotherm model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "The Jovanovich multilayer isotherm model is an empirical adsorption model that extends the Jovanovich monolayer equation to allow adsorption in second and higher layers through an exponential layer-growth term. It introduces separate constants to describe the first-layer adsorption and the contribution of multilayer formation. The model assumes mobile adsorbate molecules and does not incorporate explicit lateral interactions."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821060> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821059> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1684> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821054> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821064> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "empirical multilayer adsorption model with exponential layer growth"@en .


