###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821130
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821130> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "nonlinear parameter estimation (Dubinin-Radushkevich model)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task performs nonlinear parameter estimation using equilibrium adsorption data to determine the theoretical Dubinin-Radushkevich isotherm saturation capacity and the Dubinin-Radushkevich isotherm constant . The nonlinear Dubinin-Radushkevich equation is fitted directly to equilibrium adsorption values determined by experimental adsorption measurements, using the Polanyi potential to capture the effective adsorption work. Because the Dubinin-Radushkevich model is temperature-dependent, it can consolidate multi-temperature data into a single characteristic curve that describes micropore filling behavior."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775715> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775716> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821129> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821131> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821132> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "nonlinear estimation of Dubinin-Radushkevich parameters"@en .


