###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821263
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821263> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "nonlinear parameter estimation (UNILAN model)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task consists of estimating the UNILAN isotherm parameters by fitting the nonlinear UNILAN equation to experimental equilibrium adsorption data. The fitted parameters typically include the maximum adsorption capacity, the adsorption affinity constant, and the heterogeneity parameter. Nonlinear regression methods are required due to the logarithmic and exponential structure of the model. The task is commonly used to characterize surface heterogeneity and adsorption energetics in heterogeneous adsorbent systems."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6775715> ,
