class=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">≥</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\" data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"></mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "leaf area index equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation represents the dynamic update of leaf area index during the crop growing season. Leaf area index is treated as a state variable that evolves daily as a result of leaf expansion and senescence processes. From crop emergence to the onset of leaf decline, leaf area index is updated by adding a computed daily increment. After the start of leaf decline, leaf area index is reduced according to a phenology-dependent senescence formulation. Together, the governing equations ensure biologically realistic canopy development by allowing growth, saturation, and decline of leaf area."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1674> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821305> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "dynamic canopy leaf area index over growing season"@en .

