                                                                                          "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mrow></msup><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "radiation interception equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation estimates the amount of photosynthetically active radiation intercepted by a crop canopy using Beer’s law. Incoming solar radiation is converted to photosynthetically active radiation by applying a fixed fraction. The fraction of radiation intercepted by the canopy is modeled as an exponential function of leaf area index. The extinction coefficient represents average light attenuation within the canopy. This formulation links canopy structure directly to available energy for potential biomass production."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821308> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "estimation of photosynthetically active radiation following Beer's law"@en .

