###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821354
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821354> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of leaf area index dynamics"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes the daily evolution of leaf area index throughout the crop growing season. It updates leaf area based on phenological development during the expansion phase and reduces leaf area during senescence. The task incorporates crop-specific limits and stress modulation. The resulting leaf area index is used by radiation interception and other canopy-related processes."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821272> ,
