###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821355
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821355> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "leaf area index model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This model simulates the temporal evolution of leaf area index for a crop canopy over the growing season. Leaf area development is driven by phenological progress and constrained by crop-specific maximum values. During early growth stages, the model represents leaf expansion, while during later stages it accounts for leaf senescence and decline. Crop stress factors may reduce the rate of leaf area development relative to potential conditions. The simulated leaf area index is used to control canopy processes such as radiation interception and energy exchange."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821354> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821278> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821306> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821310> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821311> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821276> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "model simulating temporal development of canopy leaf area"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821356
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821356> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "crop canopy development"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This research problem focuses on the development of plant canopy leaf area over the growing season. Leaf area determines light interception, transpiration, and energy exchange between vegetation and the atmosphere. Canopy development depends on phenological progress, growth conditions, and senescence processes. Accurately representing these dynamics is essential for modeling crop growth and ecosystem functioning. The problem links plant structure with physiological and environmental drivers."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1513> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821355> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "temporal dynamics of canopy leaf area"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821357
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821357> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of intercepted photosynthetically active radiation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes the amount of photosynthetically active radiation intercepted by a plant canopy. It uses incoming solar radiation and canopy structural properties to estimate the absorbed radiation fraction. The computation assumes a continuous canopy and applies an exponential attenuation formulation. The resulting intercepted radiation serves as an input to biomass production and other radiation-driven processes."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821281> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821282> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821283> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821301> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821304> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821312> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821354> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "calculates canopy-intercepted photosynthetically active radiation"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821358
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821358> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "solar radiation interception model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This model estimates the fraction of incoming solar radiation that is intercepted by a plant canopy. Interception is computed as a function of incoming radiation and canopy structural properties, particularly leaf area index. The model represents attenuation of radiation within the canopy using an exponential formulation derived from physical light extinction principles. It produces an estimate of photosynthetically active radiation available for photosynthesis. The intercepted radiation serves as a key input to biomass production and other radiation-driven processes."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821357> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821312> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821355> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821276> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "model estimating canopy-intercepted solar radiation"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821359
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821359> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "estimation of canopy-intercepted solar radiation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This research problem concerns the estimation of the portion of incoming solar radiation that is intercepted by a plant canopy. Intercepted radiation determines the energy available for photosynthesis and biomass production. The amount intercepted depends on canopy structure and leaf area distribution. Accurate estimation is essential for modeling plant growth and energy exchange processes. The problem links physical radiation principles with biological canopy properties."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1513> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821358> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "quantify radiation intercepted by a plant canopy"@en .


