###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821363
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821363> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of crop height"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes crop height as a function of phenological progress during the growing season. It uses a normalized development factor to scale crop height between emergence and maturity. The task produces a deterministic estimate of crop height at each time step. The resulting height can be used to parameterize canopy structure and related processes."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
