                                               <https://schema.org/description> "calculates crop height from phenological development"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821364
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821364> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "crop height model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This model simulates the temporal development of crop height during the growing season. Crop height is represented as a function of phenological progress, reflecting structural growth of the plant. The model scales height from emergence toward a crop-specific maximum as development advances. It provides a simplified, deterministic representation of canopy vertical structure without explicitly modeling mechanical or anatomical processes. The simulated crop height is used to characterize canopy structure in crop growth and land surface models."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821363> ;
