<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821387> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of root biomass allocation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes the fraction of daily crop biomass growth that is allocated to the root system. The allocation fraction is determined as a linear function of phenological development. The task produces a deterministic estimate of daily root biomass increment, which is used to update root system mass."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
