                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>H</mi><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mi>H</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><munderover><mo movablelimits=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>F</mi><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "harvest index accumulation equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation computes the harvest index on a specific day by accumulating the harvest index heat unit factor over time. It represents the gradual allocation of above-ground biomass to crop yield as the crop develops. The formulation ensures that harvest index increases from zero at planting to its maximum value at maturity. It captures the temporal dynamics of reproductive development."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "computes daily harvest index value"@en .

