                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821426> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "calculates above-ground biomass"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821429
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821429> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of harvest index development"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes the temporal development of harvest index over the growing season. It integrates the daily heat unit-based harvest index factor to represent the progressive allocation of above ground biomass to crop yield. The task produces the harvest index value for each time step, starting from zero at planting and approaching a crop-specific maximum at maturity. It depends on the computation of the harvest index heat unit factor, which controls the rate and timing of development. The resulting harvest index is used to track the progression of reproductive development and to determine when the crop has reached its final harvest index value."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821414> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821415> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821416> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821422> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821427> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "calculates harvest index over time"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821430
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821430> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of crop economic yield"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes crop economic yield by multiplying above-ground biomass by harvest index. It produces a final yield estimate at maturity. The task assumes non-stressed conditions unless modified by additional stress models."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821415> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821418> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821419> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821424> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821428> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "calculates harvestable crop yield"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821431
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821431> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "harvest index development model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This model simulates the development of harvest index over the growing season. Harvest index represents the fraction of above-ground biomass allocated to crop yield. The model assumes that harvest index increases non-linearly from planting to maturity under non-stressed conditions. Development is controlled by phenological progress using a heat unit based scaling factor. The simulated harvest index is used to compute final crop yield."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821427> ,
                                                                                          <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821429> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821278> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821422> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821423> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821276> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "model simulating temporal development of harvest index"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821432
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821432> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q68663> ;
                                               rdfs:label "economic yield model"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This model computes crop economic yield using the harvest index concept. Economic yield is calculated as the product of harvest index and above-ground biomass at maturity. The formulation assumes that yield is proportional to accumulated vegetative production. The model provides a simplified but robust estimate of harvestable crop yield. It does not explicitly represent grain filling or reproductive organ growth."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534270> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P147> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821428> ,
                                                                                          <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821430> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821315> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821424> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821426> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P286> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821276> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "model computing crop economic yield from above-ground biomass"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821433
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821433> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "estimation of harvest index development"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This research problem addresses how crops allocate above-ground biomass to reproductive or economic organs over time. Harvest index is often relatively stable at maturity but develops dynamically during the growing season. Accurately representing its development is essential for predicting crop yield. The problem links phenological development with above-ground biomass partitioning to reproductive structures."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1513> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821431> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "quantify temporal allocation of above-ground biomass to crop yield"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821434
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821434> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "estimation of crop economic yield"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This research problem concerns the estimation of harvestable crop yield based on biomass production. Economic yield represents the portion of plant biomass that can be removed from the field. Accurate yield estimation is central to agricultural and food system modeling. The problem links biomass accumulation with reproductive allocation."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1513> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821432> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "quantify harvestable yield from above-ground crop biomass"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821435
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821435> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q60231> ;
                                               rdfs:label "agronomy"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P12> "Q173113"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Agronomy is the science and technology of producing and using plants for food, fuel, fiber, and land management. A central concern of the discipline is the estimation and improvement of crop yield under field conditions. Agronomic models translate plant growth processes into practical measures of agricultural productivity. Harvest index–based approaches provide a widely used method to link biomass production with economically relevant yield."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534268> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821434> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822043> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822115> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824238> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "science and technology of producing and using plants for food, fuel, fiber, and reclamation"@en .


