                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>Λ</mi></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mi>Λ</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "cumulative potential plant water use equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation computes the cumulative potential water use by plants from the soil surface to a specified depth. It distributes evaporative demand using an exponential depth function controlled by a soil-plant interaction parameter. The formulation reflects decreasing root activity with depth under typical conditions. It provides the basis for estimating water uptake by soil layers."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "estimates cumulative potential plant water use from the root zone"@en .

