                                               rdfs:label "potential crop water use rate in soil layer equation (total compensation)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation distributes potential plant water use among soil layers within the root zone using an exponential depth function. A compensation mechanism is employed which allows plants to offset water deficits in dry layers by increasing uptake from wetter layers."@en ;
