                                               rdfs:label "potential crop water use rate in soil layer equation (partial compensation)"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation distributes potential plant water use among soil layers within the root zone using an exponential depth function. No compensation mechanism is employed which would allows plants to offset water deficits in dry layers by increasing uptake from wetter layers."@en ;
