                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></munderover><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>K</mi></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "crop nitrogen demand equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation estimates the daily nitrogen demand of the crop as the difference between the ideal nitrogen content of the current biomass and the cumulative nitrogen uptake up to the previous day. The ideal nitrogen content is calculated as the product of accumulated biomass and an optimal nitrogen concentration. The formulation represents nitrogen demand as a dynamic, history-dependent quantity that increases with growth and decreases as nitrogen is taken up. It provides the demand side of the nitrogen balance used in the uptake adjustment."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "estimates daily crop nitrogen demand from biomass and uptake history"@en .

