                                                                                          "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>u</mi></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>W</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mn>3</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "nitrogen supply by mass flow equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation estimates the nitrogen supply from each soil layer based on mass flow of nitrate to plant roots. Nitrogen supply is computed as the product of plant water uptake in the layer and nitrate concentration in soil water. The formulation assumes that nitrate transport to roots is proportional to water flux, reflecting mass flow as the dominant nitrogen transport mechanism. It provides a layer-resolved estimate of potential nitrogen supply from the soil."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "distributes potential nitrogen supply across soil layers by water uptake"@en .

