                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P989> "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><munderover><mo movablelimits=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>M</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>U</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "total soil nitrogen supply equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation computes the total nitrogen supply available to the crop by summing the layer-specific nitrogen supply rates. It represents the total nitrogen that could be taken up by mass flow on a given day. The result serves as an intermediate quantity used to compare soil nitrogen availability with crop nitrogen demand. It links soil-layer processes to whole-plant nitrogen uptake."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "aggregates nitrogen supply from all soil layers"@en .

