###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822038
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822038> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of crop nitrogen demand"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task computes the daily nitrogen demand of the crop based on accumulated biomass and an optimal nitrogen concentration that depends on development stage. It accounts for nitrogen already taken up in previous days and produces a dynamic demand signal. The result represents the nitrogen requirement needed to sustain optimal growth."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
