                                               <https://schema.org/description> "determine daily nitrogen demand of the crop"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822039
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822039> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of soil nitrogen supply by mass flow"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task estimates the nitrogen supplied to plant roots from each soil layer through mass flow driven by plant water uptake. It combines soil nitrate content, soil water content, and layer-specific plant water use. The task produces a spatially distributed estimate of nitrogen supply from the soil."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821379> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821584> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821596> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822024> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822025> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822034> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "estimating potential nitrogen supply from soil layers"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822040
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822040> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "aggregation of soil nitrogen supply"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task aggregates nitrogen supply across all soil layers to determine the total nitrogen available for uptake by the crop on a given day. The result is used to assess whether soil nitrogen supply is sufficient to meet crop nitrogen demand."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
