                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822039> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "compute total nitrogen supply from all soil layers"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822041
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822041> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "adjustment of nitrogen uptake to crop demand"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task adjusts the potential nitrogen supply from each soil layer to ensure consistency with crop nitrogen demand. It enforces upper bounds based on soil nitrate availability and allows compensation when mass flow alone is insufficient. The result represents the actual nitrogen uptake used in crop growth calculations."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
