                                               rdfs:label "fixation growth stage equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "These piecewise equations define the growth-stage-dependent factor controlling nitrogen fixation. The factor represents the development and senescence of symbiotic nodules, suppressing fixation in early and late growth stages and allowing full fixation during mid-season. The formulation uses the heat unit index as a phenological proxy."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "phenological control of nitrogen fixation"@en .

