/mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\" data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"></mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "fixation soil water equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This equation computes a soil water limitation factor for nitrogen fixation based on topsoil moisture relative to field capacity and wilting point. Fixation is reduced when soil moisture falls below a threshold fraction of available water capacity and is not limited when soil moisture exceeds this threshold. The formulation represents moisture stress effects on symbiotic activity."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "soil moisture control of nitrogen fixation"@en .

