=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\" data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"></mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow></math>"@en ;
                                               rdfs:label "fixation soil nitrate equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "These equations describe inhibition of biological nitrogen fixation by mineral nitrate in the root zone. Fixation is fully allowed at low nitrate levels, partially reduced at intermediate nitrate concentrations, and completely suppressed when nitrate exceeds a threshold. The formulation reflects physiological feedback where external nitrate reduces symbiotic nitrogen fixation activity."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q5981696> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "nitrate control of nitrogen fixation"@en .

