                                               rdfs:label "accumulated root weight in soil layer"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This quantity represents the accumulated root weight allocated to a specific soil layer up to a specific day. It is a portion of the accumulated total root weight."@en ;
