                                               rdfs:label "soil phosphorus supply equation"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "Estimates soil phosphorus supply as a multiple of plant phosphorus demand, distributed among soil layers according to root biomass fractions and scaled by a labile phosphorus availability factor."@en ;
