###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824235
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824235> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of crop phosphorus demand"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task estimates the daily phosphorus demand of a crop based on accumulated plant biomass and an optimal phosphorus concentration that declines with phenological development. The optimal concentration is computed as a nonlinear function of heat unit index, and cumulative phosphorus uptake is subtracted to determine unmet demand."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534272> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1495> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534265> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1560> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821272> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6821277> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6822021> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824224> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824226> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824227> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824231> ,
                                                                                           <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824232> ;
                                               <https://schema.org/description> "determine daily phosphorus demand of the crop"@en .


###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824236
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6824236> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534247> ;
                                               rdfs:label "computation of soil phosphorus supply"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "This task estimates the phosphorus supply available to the crop from the soil based on plant phosphorus demand, root biomass distribution across soil layers, and labile phosphorus availability. A nonlinear labile phosphorus uptake factor modulates root-weighted supply, allowing enhanced uptake under phosphorus-deficient conditions."@en ;
