###  https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6830614
<https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6830614> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                        <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534292> ;
                                               rdfs:label "Taylor–Couette flow"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P104> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taylor%E2%80%93Couette_flow> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P12> "Q3151656"@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1459> "The stationary flow of an incompressible fluid confined in between two rotating cylinders of different radii and angular velocities is a well-known benchmark problem in numerical fluid dynamics. For low relative angular velocities and for a small gap (relative to the diameters of the cylinders), i.e., for a Reynolds number, the flow is steady and purely azimuthal, for which case an analytical solution exists."@en ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1460> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q6534269> ;
                                               <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/P1463> <https://portal.mardi4nfdi.de/entity/Q16496> ;
